#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:530 df3483f248a44486910c10b193910cc4
msgid "Releases this reverb object and frees its memory."
msgstr "释放底层 FMOD Reverb3D。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:532 4e8128d9448d42f7ab27c4c312b515d7
msgid "After calling this method, the reverb becomes invalid and should not be used."
msgstr "调用后混响对象失效，不应继续使用。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:564 72b701a80c8a4ea2a3edb817782d41d6
msgid "Returns the reverberation decay time in milliseconds."
msgstr "返回混响衰减时间，单位为毫秒。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:566 a81a354a45f945a79d265ea8ee0da443
msgid "This is the time it takes for the reverb to decay by 60dB."
msgstr "表示混响衰减 60 dB 所需的时间。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:578 ac53eb0e37ef4b87b4e7c5340535b6d6
msgid "Sets the initial reflection delay in milliseconds (range: 0.0 to 300.0)."
msgstr "设置初始反射延迟，单位为毫秒，范围为 0.0 到 300.0。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:580 4470a20863c14bf2b5c96fb14d7980f4
msgid "This is the time before the first reflections arrive. Larger rooms have longer early delays."
msgstr "表示首个反射到达前的时间。较大的房间通常有更长的早期延迟。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:592 b41a02655e0b4e51a8f050df4d7e553f
msgid "Returns the initial reflection delay time in milliseconds."
msgstr "返回初始反射延迟，单位为毫秒。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:594 104da39006c444c78fea4617920b6def
msgid "This is the time between the direct sound and the first reflections."
msgstr "表示直达声与首次反射之间的时间。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:606 18ca400df2d241f698f2e21d2882d883
msgid "Sets the late reverb delay in milliseconds (range: 0.0 to 100.0, default: 11.0)."
msgstr "设置后期混响延迟，单位为毫秒，范围为 0.0 到 100.0，默认值为 11.0。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:608 0f580c17711b4b3395f142c3c9d895cf
msgid "This is the time between early reflections and the onset of the late reverb tail."
msgstr "表示早期反射到后期混响尾音开始之间的时间。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:620 960082a769904d9f829fa424ce9ebb78
msgid "Returns the late reverb delay time in milliseconds."
msgstr "返回后期混响延迟，单位为毫秒。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:622 913854c106a747d7bfa927649a43a253
msgid "This is the time between the early reflections and the onset of the late reverb tail."
msgstr "表示早期反射与后期混响尾音开始之间的时间。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:634 5e2c64997213442ab320f6749ac11cc1
msgid "Sets the reference high frequency in Hz (range: 20.0 to 20000.0, default: 5000.0)."
msgstr "设置高频参考频率，单位为 Hz，范围为 20.0 到 20000.0，默认值为 5000.0。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:636 e5a4ea06e6404b8695cb9aa2aef12fbf
msgid "Frequencies above this value are affected by the HF decay ratio setting."
msgstr "高于该频率的信号受高频衰减比例影响。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:648 c892cc0ba1d0435d852eba3b903d9d83
msgid "Returns the reference high frequency in Hz."
msgstr "返回高频参考频率，单位为 Hz。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:650 479973440e5f4f0ab4415b54c1b416a5
msgid "Frequencies above this value are affected by the HF decay ratio."
msgstr "高于该频率的信号受高频衰减比例影响。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:708 003d2aaaf41547d4b95d547c94d64114
msgid "Returns the echo density value (0.0 to 100.0)."
msgstr "返回回声密度，范围为 0.0 到 100.0。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:656 6cf6d32c55ed45bf9e1ca239ff9dec32
msgid ""
"Controls the density of echoes in the late reverb decay. Higher values create a smoother, "
"more dense reverb tail."
msgstr "控制后期混响衰减中的回声密度，值越大，尾音越平滑、密集。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:722 6e13ecef960443e1bfcbb2964197906a
msgid "Sets the modal density (range: 0.0 to 100.0, default: 100.0)."
msgstr "设置模态密度，范围为 0.0 到 100.0，默认值为 100.0。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:670 6ab3ee171618484290f91dc0273a1455
msgid ""
"Controls the coloration of the late reverb. Lower values create more distinct echoes, higher "
"values create a smoother decay."
msgstr "控制后期混响的音色，值较低时回声更清晰，较高时衰减更平滑。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:750 a3d7e149a68b4c4189d8a300f416b344
msgid "Sets the reference low frequency in Hz (range: 20.0 to 1000.0, default: 250.0)."
msgstr "设置低频参考频率，单位为 Hz，范围为 20.0 到 1000.0，默认值为 250.0。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:752 83790248efc84f7481c5f7d415f519f7
msgid "Frequencies below this value are affected by the low shelf gain setting."
msgstr "低于该频率的信号受低架增益影响。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:764 cdc8d4d932564e9684f8d98437af3925
msgid "Returns the reference low frequency in Hz."
msgstr "返回低频参考频率，单位为 Hz。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:766 caefe0cb0a7c4f3bb789c5cea4ced29d
msgid "Frequencies below this value are affected by the low shelf gain."
msgstr "低于该频率的信号受低架增益影响。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:794 9b3278336d514fb084f769308db6fcc0
msgid "Returns the low shelf gain in dB."
msgstr "返回低架增益，单位为 dB。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:796 0b486acdf35b4703864ab17c397da188
msgid "Controls the relative room effect level for low frequencies."
msgstr "控制    ``get_low_shelf_gain``   。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:878 617b9f43ae08427181086b25022c888f
msgid "Returns the wet signal level in dB."
msgstr "返回湿信号电平，单位为 dB。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:880 ebb4b99a67f141ddb476e0c11ce2c2dd
msgid "Controls the overall reverb output level relative to the dry signal."
msgstr "控制    ``get_wet_level``   。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:21 973dfd0da4cd4dc8905b6186717061f5
msgid ""
"Represents a spherical 3D reverb environment whose contribution depends on the listener "
"position. The reverb has full influence inside ``min_distance`` and fades out by "
"``max_distance``."
msgstr "表示球形 3D 混响环境，其影响程度取决于监听者的位置。在  ``min_distance``  内完全生效，到  ``max_distance``  时淡出。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:23 c6bb65abf11f437e97533fdca02c45b6
msgid ""
"FMOD blends the environments that cover the listener. When none covers the listener, FMOD "
"uses the global reverb settings."
msgstr "FMOD 会混合覆盖监听者的混响环境；没有环境覆盖监听者时，使用全局混响设置。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:25 eb95f63b440b48c1b48bf2b1b74f5aff
msgid ""
"Create an instance with "
":ref:`FmodSystem.create_reverb_3d()<class_FmodSystem_method_create_reverb_3d>`."
msgstr "通过  :ref:`FmodSystem.create_reverb_3d()<class_FmodSystem_method_create_reverb_3d>`  创建实例。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:329 d2ffe79723794e5f905c8e9cffa7bf7f
msgid "High-cut frequency in Hz."
msgstr "高频截止频率，单位为 Hz。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:346 2a1a8f1a21e3403084fd08d3469b2925
msgid "Early/late reflection mix in percent."
msgstr "早期与后期反射的混合百分比。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:380 033c456ef16c4311a7633047aeda115c
msgid ""
"Returns ``true`` if the stored Reverb3D pointer is non-null. This checks the wrapper pointer,"
" not the native object lifetime."
msgstr "保存的 Reverb3D 指针为非空时返回  ``true`` 。此方法只检查封装中的指针，不验证底层对象的生命周期。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:392 ea0b2b62fc0b4652afd918b790131d8b
msgid ""
"Returns ``true`` if the stored Reverb3D pointer is null. This checks the wrapper pointer, not"
" the native object lifetime."
msgstr "保存的 Reverb3D 指针为空时返回  ``true`` 。此方法只检查封装中的指针，不验证底层对象的生命周期。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:482 a74aa401078641f29350968b9090ce66
msgid ""
"Returns the configured active state. Check "
":ref:`reverb_3d_is_valid()<class_FmodReverb3D_method_reverb_3d_is_valid>` separately to "
"determine whether this wrapper holds a reverb handle."
msgstr ""
"返回配置的激活状态。可另行通过  :ref:`reverb_3d_is_valid()<class_FmodReverb3D_method_reverb_3d_is_valid>`  "
"检查封装是否持有混响句柄。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:508 9fded0aa880646d2af2e190cc7af07e9
msgid ""
"Sets the reverb decay time in milliseconds, clamped to ``100.0`` through ``20000.0``. The "
"initial value is ``1500.0``."
msgstr "设置混响衰减时间，单位为毫秒，限制在  ``100.0``  到  ``20000.0``  之间，初始值为  ``1500.0`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:618 a4dbdf9ee5e847468983cc4e18072bb7
msgid ""
"Sets the high-frequency to mid-frequency decay-time ratio in percent, clamped to ``10.0`` "
"through ``200.0``. The initial value is ``83.0``."
msgstr "设置高频与中频衰减时间的百分比，限制在  ``10.0``  到  ``200.0``  之间，初始值为  ``83.0`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:630 5b8a36461b704cbfbb9634cde9710a48
msgid ""
"Returns the high-frequency to mid-frequency decay-time ratio in percent, from ``10.0`` to "
"``200.0``."
msgstr "返回高频与中频衰减时间的百分比，范围为  ``10.0``  到  ``200.0`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:642 38167d0738f04d7dbd8bdc996a9f761e
msgid ""
"Sets the late-reverb echo density in percent, clamped to ``0.0`` through ``100.0``. The "
"initial value is ``100.0``."
msgstr "设置后期混响的回声密度百分比，限制在  ``0.0``  到  ``100.0``  之间，初始值为  ``100.0`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:682 0fa256da3308461084817c76fbf127bd
msgid "Returns the modal density of the late reverb in percent, from ``0.0`` to ``100.0``."
msgstr "返回后期混响的模态密度百分比，范围为  ``0.0``  到  ``100.0`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:722 eff8c678b9754c138feea3c5b6d6a680
msgid ""
"Sets the low-shelf gain in dB, clamped to ``-36.0`` through ``12.0``. The initial value is "
"``0.0``."
msgstr "设置低频搁架增益，单位为 dB，限制在  ``-36.0``  到  ``12.0``  之间，初始值为  ``0.0`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:748 6a4f40b9e2ef4e32a138adc355233736
msgid ""
"Sets the high-cut frequency in Hz, clamped to ``20.0`` through ``20000.0``. The initial value"
" is ``14500.0``."
msgstr "设置高频截止频率，单位为 Hz，限制在  ``20.0``  到  ``20000.0``  之间，初始值为  ``14500.0`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:760 fbb8b4acedc94431a752a8e74d816c49
msgid "Returns the high-cut frequency in Hz."
msgstr "返回高频截止频率，单位为 Hz。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:772 38f90be656124167892a8e35b12b0002
msgid ""
"Sets the early/late reflection mix in percent, clamped to ``0.0`` through ``100.0``. The "
"initial value is ``96.0``."
msgstr "设置早期与后期反射的混合百分比，限制在  ``0.0``  到  ``100.0``  之间，初始值为  ``96.0`` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:784 aa316cd8edbc413686b7a4eb1fd6207a
msgid "Returns the early/late reflection mix in percent."
msgstr "返回早期与后期反射的混合百分比。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodreverb3d.rst:796 b899b38af51e40ea86cb2fb0bb066b84
msgid ""
"Sets the wet reverb level in dB, clamped to ``-80.0`` through ``20.0``. The initial value is "
"``-8.0``."
msgstr "设置混响湿声电平，单位为 dB，限制在  ``-80.0``  到  ``20.0``  之间，初始值为  ``-8.0`` 。"
